        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fullerton Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fullerton Cabinet Knob from RK International is the perfect accompaniment to any traditional home because it is simple enough to match any decor but it still has a subtile point of interest to make it a one-of-a-kind piece. The raised details really bring out the highlights of the finishes especially on the Valencia Bronze finish and the Brushed English finish. However, the Traditional Fullerton Cabinet Knob is available in 7 beautiful finishes, so you will be able to find exactly what you are looking for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/fullerton-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-626\"><b>Matching Fullerton Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-fullerton-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6626\"><b>Matching Fullerton Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-126:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-127:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
